{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12111180","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12111180","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1211118001:0":{"text":"정말 보물이 있어...","source_cn":"真的有宝藏……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA85F871C8681E69A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1211118002:0":{"text":"난 이 배가 좋아. 지금부터 이 배는 내 거야!","source_cn":"我喜欢这艘船。从现在起，它是我的了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF275E2BDA32056C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211118003:0":{"text":"이 유리병... 동화책에 나오는 바다를 떠다니는 그 표류병 같아요.","source_cn":"这个瓶子……好像童话书上的漂流瓶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDCE67B18DF9CAFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1211118004:0":{"text":"진짜 크네요... 이렇게나 큰 유리병은 거인이나 만들 수 있을 것 같아요.","source_cn":"它也太大了……只有巨人才会做这么大的漂流瓶吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA844958C087E37CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1211118005:0":{"text":"보통 이런 유리병에는 모래, 종이별, 꽃 또는 돌돌 말린 편지가 들어있죠.","source_cn":"漂流瓶里一般装的都是沙子、纸星星、花，或者是卷起来的信。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88A487EDA7352454","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1211118006:0":{"text":"어떤 유리병이 배를 실을 수 있을까요?","source_cn":"什么样的漂流瓶会装船呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6857A6271EB425B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1211118007:0":{"text":"이 배... 어딘가 익숙한데.","source_cn":"这艘船……有点眼熟啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E22682E9FBB0ED6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1211118008:0":{"text":"옆에 작은 유리병이 떨어져 있어. 내가 가볼게.","source_cn":"旁边散落着一些小的漂流瓶，我去看看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41D8F77ED51A3291","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"소니아","source":"索尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奈拉":{"text":"나라","source":"奈拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"신밧드","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":5}}